{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bbbba3a7a5aabadaabb9f862b75fd9bf82b27de3eedeec118a51e62858da195",
      "text": "偶像大运动会·会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fde4519ad740e84c4159914456f3e707d5d6a03c38afc11f4581d6c0f7c1d3",
      "text": "哈啊、哈啊…………！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:574a1ea28513171d2b5e019b72d9b05a0844c9bf3d251fd7c33baac90b1ab1de",
      "text": "……总算来了。太慢了，享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75f5fc7cecc3b06aa7a864fb4318b96a5ee0383f541bb77926f7cf9c7acf3c17",
      "text": "是你跑得太快了啦！\n……那么，开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd97fcad55dfe84cb572e118ef25b0124d127dee11aff1574101a2dfd3af50b5",
      "text": "……不好意思！W少跑了1圈！\n我们现在重新补跑——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6702cd81f04377c6016f4e725d7fae7e3194e5296fb1a88e2220644aa433d197",
      "text": "喂。你是猜到了我的想法，才回这里的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5950dfd9523450430fb0bd1a10f8421056d54ce76a35474ae8c56bfdaa0cb57e",
      "text": "不是。是因为我自己想回来才回来的。\n不过……看到悠介你在，我安心多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a4706aa96eeebf44b4004e4d19786b2b1fde0241ff8d2ed1ddc6e39ad2b170",
      "text": "说什么呢。\n真是个让人放心不下的弟弟啊～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ab228d5774fc38d3dda97a93e49528fbc94db7e291fdaebc7ea739b07079fe3",
      "text": "……唉。明明耍帅宣誓过了，\n这下肯定拿倒数第一了。太逊了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a1834e6d3265ec9a0caa92a6158919295ce8c41ecc89a51b54e0132d30bc269",
      "text": "315 Pro的大家，可不会觉得我们逊哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05252d9634ca437bdedc6189a90081ccf04c817f2c4925e1091bc9fe507c4d9e",
      "text": "神速一魂他们俩，\n听说我要折返的时候感动得不行呢。……不过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da7396690e1a9534d7cf7db544b222cb79542d77b20c8bcf95230101cc0c76f",
      "text": "……输掉果然还是很不甘心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0219c7ef87db5e4b3c55cc2eac1a713de47a38a16ff6d0b057fe9c74fa497682",
      "text": "算是吧。既然要比就不想输。\n赢下比赛的感觉很棒，也很痛快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dae66c4ef01a4a85c1d92f8b53b5fc2ead94a438aadbcc7bc52599b8b61af057",
      "text": "……但是啊。我喜欢的东西还有很多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
